ay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world of conflicting duality and supernatural forces. The Directorate: Novitiate is your journey into adulthood through gritty action, magic, and drama. What kind of Mercury are you?</p>","developers":["Nesting Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883830/144532030757a61944f25d8593bdccf45eea98b7/header.jpg?t=1759474556","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All Rights Reserved @ Nesting Games, 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1883830/1453666305/eb4c3ed270cc12d15b7a4dd3075ff6e8121350fb/1759346423/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759346991","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1883830/1453666305/eb4c3ed270cc12d15b7a4dd3075ff6e8121350fb/1759346423/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759346991","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1883830/1453666305/eb4c3ed270cc12d15b7a4dd3075ff6e8121350fb/1759346423/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759346991","id":257210293,"name":"Directorate Novitiate - Demo Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210293/480194574cbfe6ab9b451536d56e3a978d91ac0f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759346991"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1883830/1141170649/b6563a1df1cb40d5f9aa30177c07e53aaaf45fe6/1751042897/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747145587","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1883830/1141170649/b6563a1df1cb40d5f9aa30177c07e53aaaf45fe6/17510